After accidentally hitting a co-aligned unicorn at the Northwest and
YASD:ing because of that, I made a small update to the paranoid patch.

Now it also expects the full 'yes' as positive answer to the prompt for
attacking peaceful monsters, if the newly added option paranoid_hit is on.

The updated paranoid patch and my combined patch are available at
http://www.netsonic.fi/~walker/nethack.html
and here is an incremental patch for those of you who already have my
patch collection installed:

